# Restricted and sealed material: never commit
studies/*/restricted/*
!studies/*/restricted/README.md
**/production_seed_manifest*.json
**/sealed_seed_values*.json
**/held_out*.json
**/participant_data/**
**/organizational_event_logs/**
**/credentials/**

# Locked outputs are generated only after a successful pre-lock gate
simulation/output/locked/

# Local submission and similarity-system exports
similarity-reports/
submission-portal-exports/

# Working-session transcripts are not research artifacts
context.txt
temp.txt

# Third-party full-text bodies are retained locally but never redistributed
